WEBVTT

00:03.887 --> 00:07.117
Come clean and admit your crime,
you failure.

00:08.447 --> 00:10.707
What a barbaric, boring conclusion.

00:13.517 --> 00:17.917
Did you think a delicate girl like me 
would face a barbaric man like you alone?

00:18.817 --> 00:22.627
I was hoping Ram was
mistaken about all this.

00:26.167 --> 00:29.097
Tell me... What happened, Subaru?

00:29.647 --> 00:31.307
Why did all this...

00:31.737 --> 00:33.147
I-It was—

00:33.147 --> 00:36.487
Maybe he'll feel up to talking 
if we give him a little pain.

00:36.487 --> 00:37.437
Wait!

00:37.437 --> 00:39.917
We were going to talk to Subaru 
because he was acting strange!

00:39.917 --> 00:40.787
Wasn't that the plan?

00:40.787 --> 00:42.277
You are too soft, Lady Emilia.

00:43.137 --> 00:46.987
Remember the Sin Archbishop
who could take others' forms?

00:47.467 --> 00:51.787
Isn't it possible that Sin 
Archbishop has taken Barusu's form?

00:51.787 --> 00:52.927
Well...

00:52.927 --> 00:54.877
I'll make him talk right now.

00:54.877 --> 00:57.747
He'll tell us where the 
real Barusu and Meili are.

00:58.087 --> 01:01.207
<i>They weren't the ones who moved Meili?</i>

00:58.087 --> 00:59.927
Ram, please, stop this!

00:59.927 --> 01:02.877
You can't just decide 
whether he's real or not!

01:01.207 --> 01:03.617
I lost my memories!

01:09.517 --> 01:13.247
After all this... What kind of joke is that?!

01:12.217 --> 01:13.247
Ram!

01:13.247 --> 01:16.747
You heard Subaru! There must be a reason!

01:20.127 --> 01:21.017
And Rem?

01:22.577 --> 01:23.777
What happens to Rem?

01:24.437 --> 01:25.737
Stay out of my way!

01:29.997 --> 01:32.027
Tell me again that you forgot.

01:32.027 --> 01:33.827
No... That's not...

01:34.797 --> 01:38.827
Tell me one more time, with that 
face and voice, that you forgot Rem.

01:38.827 --> 01:39.707
Don't, Ram!

01:47.887 --> 01:48.997
Ow...

01:53.057 --> 01:54.377
The cage...

01:56.547 --> 01:58.807
Where are Emilia and Ram?

02:01.647 --> 02:02.607
<b>Subaru Natsuki Was Here</b>

02:04.027 --> 02:04.897
<b>Subaru Natsuki Was Here</b>

02:06.607 --> 02:07.857
<b>Subaru Natsuki Was Here</b>

02:11.697 --> 02:12.917
Huh?

02:12.917 --> 02:16.407
The hell is with this creepy-ass room?

02:16.407 --> 02:20.377
Why would you decorate a room 
with nasty shit like this,

02:21.677 --> 02:22.947
bro?

02:30.967 --> 02:34.597
Hah! The hell's with that face, bro?

02:34.597 --> 02:36.567
You chicken or what?

02:36.567 --> 02:38.487
You look like you're gonna cry.

02:41.737 --> 02:44.007
You get into a fight with your buddies?

02:44.007 --> 02:44.767
That's funny.

02:44.767 --> 02:47.097
W-Wait! You...

02:47.097 --> 02:50.777
You said you couldn't come down 
from the floor above here!

02:50.777 --> 02:53.277
Your assumption fell apart, that's all.

02:53.767 --> 02:56.487
My assumption fell apart? Why—

02:56.887 --> 02:57.627
Ow!

02:57.627 --> 03:02.217
Dumbass. Don't go thinkin' you'll 
get answers to everything.

03:02.217 --> 03:03.687
I can walk around.

03:03.687 --> 03:05.247
So I'm goin' outside.

03:05.547 --> 03:08.337
Outside? Outside the tower?

03:08.737 --> 03:11.937
Just gotta clean up one little regret.

03:12.997 --> 03:14.697
Regret?

03:14.697 --> 03:17.807
Wait, what about the exam, then?!

03:22.417 --> 03:24.917
Aw, hell. Here he comes.

03:42.497 --> 03:44.497
I don't see your other buddies.

03:45.127 --> 03:48.627
Well, that just makes
this easier, I guess.

03:56.867 --> 04:00.727
This is the perfect chance 
to get that guy killed!

04:00.727 --> 04:03.677
Now you'll get to read 
another book of the dead!

04:13.527 --> 04:16.617
Behind you, Julius!

04:23.327 --> 04:26.957
Hah! Weaklings don't have a lot of options!

04:26.957 --> 04:30.047
All they ever get good at is making excuses.

04:39.137 --> 04:41.427
Why are you here?

04:41.427 --> 04:44.117
Why? What? How?

04:44.117 --> 04:47.017
You're asking the same questions 
he did. You bosom buddies?

04:50.267 --> 04:53.047
Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!

04:59.827 --> 05:02.227
Now, back to the exam.

05:02.227 --> 05:05.787
Try to rip this outta my hands 
before I get bored, bro.

05:09.607 --> 05:11.127
Echidna...

05:11.127 --> 05:12.837
Take care of Echidna and Lady Anastasia!

05:18.017 --> 05:18.987
Hah!

05:19.967 --> 05:23.217
That disposition of yours 
really never changes, huh?

05:32.937 --> 05:35.597
Where do you think you're going?

05:38.447 --> 05:41.577
Why'd you help that guy, anyway?

05:43.567 --> 05:45.907
After you wrung my neck, even.

05:47.227 --> 05:48.317
Subaru!

05:48.317 --> 05:49.687
I've been looking for you!

05:49.687 --> 05:51.477
You shouldn't go that way, I suppose!

05:51.477 --> 05:52.837
Why are you outside the cage?

05:53.177 --> 05:54.957
Beatrice, get away from him!

05:54.957 --> 05:58.257
Ram told me he isn't the Natsuki you know!

05:58.257 --> 05:58.927
Ram?

05:58.927 --> 06:02.757
<i>That's right.
I didn't kill Emilia and Ram.</i>

06:02.757 --> 06:04.537
That's not true!

06:04.537 --> 06:07.077
Once I hold his hand,
I'll know, I suppose!

06:07.077 --> 06:09.297
Still, we can't trust him.

06:09.857 --> 06:12.727
I should've just obeyed
Ana's gut instinct.

06:12.727 --> 06:16.747
I never should have
brought anyone else here.

06:17.997 --> 06:19.927
This is my failure.

06:19.927 --> 06:22.947
So what? That doesn't even matter!

06:22.947 --> 06:24.867
This tower's done for!

06:24.867 --> 06:26.287
What's wrong with you, Subaru?

06:26.287 --> 06:28.827
It isn't like you to talk 
like that, I suppose!

06:28.827 --> 06:31.087
And what <i>is</i> "like me"?!

06:31.087 --> 06:33.417
Where is the "me" that you guys see?!

06:33.417 --> 06:38.167
You're still sticking to the pathetic 
lie that you lost your memories?

06:38.567 --> 06:40.427
Ram's forgotten her sister,

06:40.427 --> 06:42.927
and Julius has been forgotten by everyone,

06:42.927 --> 06:45.387
and you still continue this cruel act?

06:45.387 --> 06:47.957
Act? You think this is an act?!

06:47.957 --> 06:51.307
You're saying what I'm doing
now is an act?!

06:51.307 --> 06:55.127
If I could act, don't you think I'd
act out something better than this?!

06:55.127 --> 06:58.817
Who the hell would <i>want</i>
to become Subaru Natsuki?!

06:59.207 --> 07:01.657
A disgusting creep like this?!

07:02.637 --> 07:04.937
None of you know anything!

07:04.937 --> 07:06.437
Who am I?!

07:06.437 --> 07:08.657
I lost everything!

07:09.127 --> 07:11.487
I was going home
from the convenience store!

07:11.487 --> 07:14.667
I didn't talk to anyone all day 
other than the clerk there!

07:14.667 --> 07:16.967
And then, suddenly, another world?

07:16.967 --> 07:18.707
A tower in the sand? Corpses?!

07:18.707 --> 07:22.447
Exams?! Fakes?! Subaru Natsuki?!

07:22.447 --> 07:24.047
Screw you!

07:24.047 --> 07:26.797
Screw you all!

07:29.047 --> 07:32.517
I bet you're wondering why I 
just suddenly lost my shit, huh?

07:32.517 --> 07:35.247
Well, I just suddenly hit my limit!

07:35.247 --> 07:37.227
Something in me just snapped!

07:37.617 --> 07:40.977
I can't do anything, even if I want to!

07:40.977 --> 07:42.267
So...

07:43.907 --> 07:47.437
So... please forgive me.

07:48.427 --> 07:49.967
Please forgive me.

07:50.537 --> 07:53.217
Just let me go home already.

07:54.687 --> 07:59.797
If God's trying to punish 
me for something, I get it.

08:00.397 --> 08:03.427
I was wrong!

08:05.077 --> 08:06.307
Subaru...

08:07.217 --> 08:10.327
Beatrice, go with him.

08:10.327 --> 08:12.017
I'll look for Julius.

08:12.017 --> 08:13.307
Understood.

08:13.307 --> 08:15.507
Come on, Subaru. For now, just—

08:17.107 --> 08:19.357
And what's the meaning of this?

08:19.797 --> 08:21.767
I considered that a compromise.

08:21.767 --> 08:23.317
So why are you doing this?

08:25.757 --> 08:27.657
Julius asked me to.

08:27.657 --> 08:28.997
He did?

08:36.667 --> 08:38.957
Incomplete E-M-T, I suppose!

08:49.647 --> 08:53.927
Natsuki... Please don't do 
such unpredictable things.

08:53.927 --> 08:55.997
Like I could help it!

08:55.997 --> 08:58.017
It was a spur-of-the-moment thing!

08:59.937 --> 09:01.397
El Jiwaldo!

09:15.717 --> 09:19.117
Just what are you?

09:19.117 --> 09:20.627
What do you hope to accomplish?

09:20.627 --> 09:22.297
Whose side are you on?

09:22.627 --> 09:24.547
I don't know, either.

09:26.217 --> 09:28.047
Because I...

09:28.047 --> 09:29.797
Lost your memories.

09:30.937 --> 09:34.347
You don't even remember when you took 
Betty out of the mansion, I suppose?

09:35.297 --> 09:36.457
Sorry...

09:37.477 --> 09:38.727
I...

09:38.727 --> 09:39.817
It's fine.

09:40.357 --> 09:42.377
You may have forgotten it,

09:42.377 --> 09:44.107
but Betty never will.

09:44.887 --> 09:46.567
I'll always remember.

09:48.027 --> 09:51.377
Let's move. We can't stay here.

09:51.377 --> 09:53.727
Echidna, you...

09:53.727 --> 09:55.497
I still have my misgivings about you.

09:55.817 --> 09:58.837
But right now, I have to prioritize.

09:58.837 --> 10:00.707
It's a necessary mindset for any merchant.

10:01.067 --> 10:04.157
I've been seeing that 
up close for a long time.

10:04.157 --> 10:05.387
All right.

10:28.697 --> 10:30.687
Enough.

10:31.557 --> 10:32.997
Just... leave me.

10:34.647 --> 10:38.057
Damn it... Damn it, damn it, damn it!

10:38.057 --> 10:39.167
Natsuki...

10:40.167 --> 10:42.667
You've... done enough...

10:42.667 --> 10:44.127
Like hell I have!

10:44.627 --> 10:48.037
Nothing I've done has been enough!

10:49.237 --> 10:53.847
Shouldn't Beatrice... come before me?

11:01.377 --> 11:02.747
I see.

11:03.637 --> 11:06.997
She was truly... an unfortunate girl.

11:08.897 --> 11:10.077
It hurts.

11:10.797 --> 11:13.307
Oh, how it hurts.

11:14.237 --> 11:17.487
Human bodies are so painful.

11:18.107 --> 11:18.997
Sorry...

11:19.557 --> 11:20.407
Sorry!

11:20.407 --> 11:22.367
It's not... I didn't mean to...

11:23.037 --> 11:23.567
I—

11:23.567 --> 11:28.087
This pain...
is the only way I can repay Ana.

11:29.157 --> 11:30.797
I mean, isn't it?

11:31.457 --> 11:34.067
If I were to return her body to her now...

11:34.067 --> 11:39.727
she'd have to feel this pain... 
and this fear of death.

11:40.947 --> 11:45.517
Don't feel like... you have 
to make it easier for me.

11:47.117 --> 11:50.187
This... is fine with me.

11:50.187 --> 11:52.907
Hey, did you hear that?

11:53.237 --> 11:56.477
Isn't this what they call a windfall?

12:01.827 --> 12:04.537
It's all right, Big Brother.

12:04.537 --> 12:07.597
You're just putting her out of her misery.

12:36.637 --> 12:43.357
You can't even do something 
that simple, Subaru Natsuki?

12:45.267 --> 12:46.707
Natsuki...

12:47.877 --> 12:53.377
You can't even lift a rock 
to put me out of my misery.

12:55.147 --> 12:58.447
Sorry... for doubting you.

13:05.567 --> 13:07.347
Why don't you just die?

13:11.367 --> 13:12.897
Yeah...

13:21.067 --> 13:22.427
I love you.

13:27.037 --> 13:28.127
I love you.

13:28.577 --> 13:29.747
I love you.

13:30.007 --> 13:30.997
I love you.

13:31.437 --> 13:32.627
I love you.

13:32.847 --> 13:33.877
I love you.

13:34.257 --> 13:35.337
I love you.

13:35.527 --> 13:36.587
I love you.

13:36.967 --> 13:39.237
Stop it! I'm sick of this!

13:39.237 --> 13:41.237
<i>I</i> don't!

13:41.237 --> 13:45.297
<i>I</i> don't... love me!

13:46.387 --> 13:49.017
I knew I was loved.

13:49.017 --> 13:51.227
I knew it!

13:51.967 --> 13:56.887
My mom and dad loved me from 
the bottom of their hearts.

13:56.887 --> 14:00.287
I knew it! How the hell could I not?!

14:01.987 --> 14:06.007
That's why... I wished 
I could just disappear.

14:06.007 --> 14:08.287
My parents loved me so much,

14:08.287 --> 14:12.337
but I could never love someone 
like me who wasn't worth loving!

14:12.337 --> 14:13.797
I love you.

14:13.797 --> 14:15.317
Stop it!

14:13.797 --> 14:18.277
I love you. I love you. I love you.

14:15.317 --> 14:18.947
Give me a break! Isn't this enough?!

14:18.277 --> 14:22.757
I love you. I love you. I love you.

14:18.947 --> 14:22.757
I already knew the answer ages ago!

14:22.757 --> 14:26.137
The people who tried so desperately... 
with all they had...

14:26.137 --> 14:29.807
to be nice to me
could never be bad people!

14:29.807 --> 14:31.917
I knew that!

14:33.577 --> 14:37.337
That's why I should have died.

14:38.277 --> 14:40.967
If this can be the end of it...

14:40.967 --> 14:46.117
If Subaru Natsuki can just 
disappear, and that'll end it...

14:47.557 --> 14:51.487
I love you. I love you. I love you.

14:51.767 --> 14:55.607
I love you. I love you. I love you.

14:55.827 --> 14:59.857
I love you. I love you. I love you.

15:00.027 --> 15:04.227
I love you. I love you. I love you.

15:04.407 --> 15:08.487
I love you. I love you. I love you.

15:08.647 --> 15:12.807
I love you. I love you. I love you.

15:13.067 --> 15:17.437
I love you. I love you. I love you.

15:17.437 --> 15:19.317
That's enough!

15:22.297 --> 15:23.267
Subaru!

15:37.527 --> 15:38.507
Enough.

15:38.507 --> 15:38.917
Huh?

15:38.917 --> 15:40.847
I've had enough!

15:43.567 --> 15:45.597
Why are you trying to help me?

15:45.937 --> 15:46.707
Subaru...

15:46.707 --> 15:48.067
Something's wrong with you!

15:48.067 --> 15:51.057
You and Julius and Beatrice!

15:51.397 --> 15:55.017
Even Echidna was apologizing 
to me in the end!

15:55.017 --> 15:56.887
It makes no sense!

15:56.887 --> 15:59.277
Echidna... in the end?

15:59.277 --> 16:02.307
Subaru, what happened? 
Where are Echidna and—

16:02.307 --> 16:03.237
They're dead!

16:03.237 --> 16:05.107
Her legs blew off!

16:05.107 --> 16:07.117
She was hurt so bad.
She lost so much blood...

16:07.117 --> 16:08.867
Same with Beatrice!

16:13.137 --> 16:15.477
And Julius... "Go," he said...

16:15.477 --> 16:16.737
"Take care of them," he said...

16:16.737 --> 16:17.817
What an idiot.

16:19.257 --> 16:20.867
They're all idiots.

16:23.127 --> 16:25.647
What do they expect of me?

16:26.247 --> 16:27.527
"Take care of them"?

16:27.527 --> 16:28.887
"Get her back"?

16:29.367 --> 16:31.427
"Sorry I doubted you"?

16:32.297 --> 16:33.687
What are you talking about?

16:39.497 --> 16:45.287
You and I first met at a place in 
the capital called the loot house.

16:45.287 --> 16:46.107
Huh?

16:47.257 --> 16:52.787
At the time, Felt had stolen my insignia, 
something very important to me.

16:52.787 --> 16:57.137
Puck and I were panicking 
about how to get it back.

16:57.137 --> 17:00.047
Then after chasing Felt down,

17:00.047 --> 17:02.587
I became a target
for Meili's older sister...

17:03.037 --> 17:06.297
and you saved my life.

17:08.367 --> 17:11.937
That's how you and I first met.

17:14.217 --> 17:15.497
Do you remember?

17:17.727 --> 17:22.467
But you were badly hurt protecting me,

17:22.467 --> 17:26.327
so I took you back to 
Roswaal's mansion with me.

17:26.327 --> 17:30.407
Beatrice healed you there, though 
she complained all the while.

17:31.387 --> 17:34.747
Then Ram... and Rem, too, I'm sure...

17:34.747 --> 17:36.867
became your friends.

17:38.577 --> 17:41.817
And then Meili, rather than her sister,

17:41.817 --> 17:44.727
sent mabeasts to do evil things to us.

17:44.727 --> 17:47.247
You and Ram stopped her,

17:47.247 --> 17:49.537
Roswaal took care of the mabeasts,

17:49.537 --> 17:51.307
and I just stayed home.

17:51.877 --> 17:54.377
That was when we promised 
to go on a "date," too.

17:55.547 --> 17:56.637
Do you remember?

18:03.317 --> 18:07.277
Then I was called to the capital 
for the royal selection, and...

18:07.987 --> 18:12.117
that was the first time you 
and I had a really big fight.

18:13.067 --> 18:18.047
I didn't want you to be reckless 
and get yourself hurt again,

18:18.047 --> 18:21.547
and I didn't understand why 
you were so kind to me.

18:21.547 --> 18:22.587
I was scared.

18:23.527 --> 18:28.297
So when we fought, I was 
sure it was all over, but...

18:31.127 --> 18:33.767
When I didn't know what was happening

18:33.767 --> 18:36.927
and I was being swept away in a 
situation that didn't feel right,

18:37.607 --> 18:42.037
you rushed to my rescue... and...

18:46.487 --> 18:51.487
Do you remember what you said to me then?

18:59.597 --> 19:02.127
But I remember all of it.

19:02.777 --> 19:06.317
Everything you said for me, did for me,

19:06.317 --> 19:08.587
and promised you'd do for me.

19:09.187 --> 19:11.157
I remember all of it.

19:12.627 --> 19:13.927
I don't remember!

19:14.357 --> 19:16.407
I <i>can't</i> remember!

19:16.407 --> 19:17.667
You...

19:17.667 --> 19:20.087
You... All of you...

19:20.087 --> 19:22.187
Who the hell are you talking about?!

19:22.187 --> 19:24.397
Someone who can risk his life for others?!

19:24.397 --> 19:26.697
Someone who can take
action in a heartbeat?!

19:26.697 --> 19:29.067
Someone who can take off 
running to help others?!

19:29.067 --> 19:32.607
Someone who can put his own life 
on the line to accomplish things?!

19:32.977 --> 19:34.567
Get real!

19:34.567 --> 19:37.037
Someone like that can't be Subaru Natsuki!

19:37.037 --> 19:41.137
I know just how pathetic and 
useless Subaru Natsuki is!

19:41.137 --> 19:44.497
I know he's a good-for-nothing 
scumbag who's rotten to the core!

19:44.497 --> 19:48.087
Subaru Natsuki is a good-for-nothing 
scumbag who's rotten to the core!

19:48.087 --> 19:51.547
I know that better than anyone!

19:55.917 --> 19:58.577
Why should it have to be me?

20:00.407 --> 20:05.357
Someone much stronger or
smarter can do it.

20:05.817 --> 20:10.067
But I... I can't do it. I can't.

20:15.497 --> 20:17.677
My name is Emilia.

20:17.677 --> 20:18.867
Just Emilia.

20:23.567 --> 20:27.757
There are so many things
I need to tell you,

20:27.757 --> 20:29.587
and things I need to ask you.

20:30.197 --> 20:33.127
But right now, just tell me one thing.

20:34.647 --> 20:38.097
Please... tell me your name.

20:40.027 --> 20:41.897
Why?

20:42.557 --> 20:44.847
Why must it be Subaru Natsuki now?

20:44.847 --> 20:46.777
What can he even do?

20:46.777 --> 20:48.767
What do you expect from him?!

20:50.107 --> 20:52.237
You might be right.

20:52.767 --> 20:55.137
There are people who
are stronger than you,

20:55.137 --> 20:57.927
and plenty who are smarter, too, I'm sure.

20:58.557 --> 21:01.777
But... no matter what happens,

21:01.777 --> 21:04.007
you're the one I want to be with.

21:04.007 --> 21:07.577
I hope and believe that 
that's what you'll do.

21:08.177 --> 21:09.027
Because...

21:10.487 --> 21:12.257
Because if someone's going to help me,

21:12.787 --> 21:16.967
rather than someone who does it because 
they can, or because they're there...

21:18.327 --> 21:23.177
I'd be much, much happier 
if it's someone I love.

21:28.357 --> 21:29.667
Oh...

21:31.757 --> 21:33.347
<i>Subaru Natsuki...</i>

21:34.317 --> 21:37.167
<i>You were in love with 
a beautiful girl like this?</i>

21:38.107 --> 21:41.027
<i>And that was the source 
of your strength, huh?</i>

21:44.017 --> 21:47.007
<i>Could she be any more out of your league?</i>

21:47.007 --> 21:49.677
<i>How do you get to aim so high?</i>

21:50.187 --> 21:53.297
<i>How does a loser like you end 
up with a beauty like her?</i>

21:53.837 --> 21:56.137
My name is Emilia.

21:56.137 --> 21:57.507
Just Emilia.

22:03.547 --> 22:04.517
Please...

22:05.477 --> 22:07.397
tell me your name.

22:27.217 --> 22:29.747
My name is Subaru Natsuki.

22:31.187 --> 22:33.427
The man Julius trusted,

22:33.427 --> 22:35.447
Beatrice believed in,

22:35.447 --> 22:37.077
Echidna forgave...

22:37.787 --> 22:40.657
and you, Emilia, hope for...

22:40.657 --> 22:43.137
If his name is Subaru Natsuki...

22:43.887 --> 22:46.097
then I'm Subaru Natsuki.

22:46.837 --> 22:48.887
<i>I want to help them.</i>

22:48.887 --> 22:50.927
<i>I want to save them from this tower.</i>

22:50.927 --> 22:53.187
<i>If Subaru Natsuki can do that,</i>

22:53.187 --> 22:55.067
<i>I'm going to do it.</i>

22:55.737 --> 23:00.027
Thank you for letting 
me believe that, Emilia.

23:01.697 --> 23:02.737
Subaru,

23:03.687 --> 23:04.487
I—

23:11.387 --> 23:12.497
Emilia!

23:14.917 --> 23:16.957
Emilia!

23:29.677 --> 23:31.137
Subaru!

23:36.517 --> 23:39.607
<i>Is this gonna end with us 
getting swallowed up in that?</i>

23:40.657 --> 23:43.027
<i>No. This is not the end.</i>

23:43.397 --> 23:47.507
<i>This... This is gonna be where it begins!</i>

23:48.967 --> 23:50.327
<i>I'll remember.</i>

23:51.287 --> 23:53.207
<i>I'll remember everything!</i>

23:55.547 --> 23:57.687
Even if you forget me...

23:58.707 --> 24:06.137
<b>Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-</b>

23:58.967 --> 24:02.147
I'll never forget any of you!

24:05.297 --> 24:06.137
Subaru!

24:06.137 --> 24:08.167
Hey, Subaru!

24:08.167 --> 24:09.397
Are you all right?

24:14.517 --> 24:16.287
Oh, what a relief!

24:16.287 --> 24:18.167
I was so worried about you!

24:18.167 --> 24:21.037
Emilia, you need to be firmer or he...

24:26.797 --> 24:28.757
I'm back.
